          "id": "world-cop31-overtime-2026-11-20",
          "headline": "Update: COP31 climate talks end with no deal after EU rejects final text",
          "summary": "The UN climate summit in Antalya, Turkey, collapsed on Sunday after a record two days of overtime. COP31 president Murat Kurum told the closing session the text was not adopted because some countries opposed it. The EU, speaking through Ireland's Darragh O'Brien, said it would not back a deal that does not mention fossil fuels, and Panama also objected.",
          "why_it_matters": "With no agreement, there is no new global push to cut oil, gas and coal use from this year's summit.",
